<title>USA: TABLE - Golden Books cuts Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Golden Books cuts Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.52     loss	 $1.19</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,292     loss	24,464</p>
